{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Star.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.proj_selfadjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.proj_selfadjoint","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedBaerStarHq.lean#L45-L45","doc":"**The conjecture** (Baer-* property): every projection is\nself-adjoint under the bar involution — i.e. each depth piece\n$G^{(n)}$ is a Baer-*-ring and the inclusions preserve projections.\n(The $*$-involution law `star_star` itself is now free from\n`InvolutiveStar`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.IsProjection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.IsProjection","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedBaerStarHq.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The orthogonal projections. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.depth","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedBaerStarHq.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Iterated-integral depth grading $G^{(n)}(\\mathcal{H}_q)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedBaerStarHq.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedBaerStarHq","kind":"class","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedBaerStarHq.lean#L26-L45","doc":"**Graded Baer-* on $\\mathcal{H}_q$ across the depth filtration.**\n\n`Hq` is the substrate convolution Hopf algebra with its bar\ninvolution $*\\colon q \\mapsto q^{-1}$ (a real `InvolutiveStar`);\n`depth` is the iterated-integral depth grading $G^{(0)} \\subseteq\nG^{(1)} \\subseteq \\cdots$.\n\nConjectural class — see\n[`conj:graded-baer-star-hq`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/graded-baer-star-Hq.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:graded-baer-star-Hq","label":"conj:graded-baer-star-Hq","md":"quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/graded-baer-star-Hq.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}